<title>PORTUGAL: Lusomundo has '96 profit after '95 loss.</title>
<headline>Lusomundo has '96 profit after '95 loss.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Dec 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated) Net 1.095 profit vs 0.801 loss Net after minority interests 0.904 profit vs 0.614 loss Turnover 35.977 vs 27.661  </p>
<p>Operating result 1.67 vs 1.945 Operating cash flow 3.625 vs 3.719 Financial result 1.474 vs 2.148 Extraordinary result 1.255 profit vs 0.299 loss NOTE - Lusomundo is a Portuguese entertainment and media company.</p>
</text>
